{"synopsis":"Yong Hwarin, seorang pewaris Klan Tianzhong yang memiliki penyakit, akhirnya menyerah pada jalan seni bela diri dan hidup sebagai pedagang setelah menikah dengan keluarga lain.\n\nMembawa penyesalan hingga saat-saat terakhirnya, secara tak terduga dia melakukan regresi ke masa lalu yang dia pikir tidak akan pernah dia temui lagi...!\n\nKembali ke masa-masa di mana dia berada di titik terendahnya, dia bersmpah dalam hatinya jika takdir baru akan terlahir kembali melalui tangannya sendiri.","alternative_title":"천중용문","author":"Gunju","artist":"Mukji","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"03992cde-a10a-420a-bd29-28d05cc19fa1","number":"55","chapter":"55","title":"SEASON 1 END","date":"2026-04-30","released":"2026-04-30","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5ee05be8-de4d-4bfd-bd12-e2777ed7301d/chapter_ch_55/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5ee05be8-de4d-4bfd-bd12-e2777ed7301d/chapter_ch_55/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5ee05be8-de4d-4bfd-bd12-e2777ed7301d/chapter_ch_55/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5ee05be8-de4d-4bfd-bd12-e2777ed7301d/chapter_ch_55/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5ee05be8-de4d-4bfd-bd12-e2777ed7301d/chapter_ch_55/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5ee05be8-de4d-4bfd-bd12-e2777ed7301d/chapter_ch_55/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5ee05be8-de4d-4bfd-bd12-e2777ed7301d/chapter_ch_55/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5ee05be8-de4d-4bfd-bd12-e2777ed7301d/chapter_ch_55/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5ee05be8-de4d-4bfd-bd12-e2777ed7301d/chapter_ch_55/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5ee05be8-de4d-4bfd-bd12-e2777ed7301d/chapter_ch_55/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"d102588b-96ee-4166-abe2-3caff8b1c7db","number":"54","chapter":"54","title":"","date":"2026-04-30","released":"2026-04-30","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_5ee05be8-de4d-4bfd-bd12-e2777ed7301d/chapter_ch_54/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/